              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.25.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Fal 25:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basi nena wewe, Bwana MUNGU asema hivi; Je! Huo utafanikiwa? Yeye hataing'oa mizizi yake na kuyakata matunda yake, ili ukauke? Kwamba majani mabichi yake yote yachipukayo yakauke, hata ikiwa hana nguvu nyingi, wala watu wengi wa kuung'oa na mizizi yake? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
